# ── Docker build-context exclusions ──────────────────────────────
# 只对"以仓库根为 build context"的构建生效:deploy/k8s/Dockerfile.cpp、
# Dockerfile.runtime(tools/scripts/k8s_image.ps1)、Dockerfile.robot(robot_stress.ps1)、根 Dockerfile。
# Go 服务(context=go/)、Java(context=java/<svc>/)、sandbox-mock(context=go/)、
# robot/Dockerfile(context=robot/)不读这个文件。
# 模式都以 context 根为锚点:`bin/` 只排除根下的 bin/,不影响 deploy/k8s/runtime/linux/bin。
# 排除一个被 COPY 的路径不会"少传点文件",而是让构建直接报
#   failed to compute cache key: "/<路径>": not found
# 改这里之前先 grep 上面几个 Dockerfile 的 COPY 源。

# ── Large third-party sources (cloned inside Docker instead) ───
third_party/grpc/
# OpenSSL headers come from apt libssl-dev
third_party/openssl/

# Windows pre-built libraries — not used in Linux Docker builds
lib/

# Build outputs and IDE files
bin/
x64/
vsout/
*.user
*.suo
*.sdf
*.db

# OS / editor
.git
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Java build output
java/**/target/

# Go build caches
go/**/tmp/

# Deploy staging:deploy/k8s/runtime/linux/ **不能**排除。
# k8s_image.ps1 build-image(k8s-build-image / k8s-release-* / publish_images.ps1 的 cpp 族)
# 以仓库根为 context 执行 Dockerfile.runtime 的 `COPY ${RUNTIME_ROOT}/ /app/`,
# 默认 RUNTIME_ROOT=deploy/k8s/runtime/linux;以前这里排除了它,该路径必然 not found。
# Dockerfile.cpp 不 COPY 它,BuildKit 只传 COPY 引用到的路径,不会把 staging 带进 C++ 全量构建。

# Docs and non-build assets
docs/
data/
test/

# robot/ 是 Dockerfile.robot 的构建输入(COPY robot/ + -mod=vendor),不能整目录排除;
# 以前整目录排除导致该镜像构建不出来。只排除本地运行产物与 Windows 调试二进制:
# go build 需要的是 *.go、go.mod/go.sum、vendor/ 与各子包目录,robot 无 go:embed。
robot/logs/
robot/*.exe
robot/__debug_bin*
robot/*.csv
robot/*.jsonl
robot/.last_stress_dir.txt

# ...but the navmesh binaries under data/ ARE a build input:
# deploy/k8s/Dockerfile.cpp stage 3 does
#   COPY data/scene_nav_bin/ /app/data/scene_nav_bin/
# and the blanket `data/` above made that fail with
#   failed to compute cache key: "/data/scene_nav_bin": not found
# BuildKit resolves stage-3 COPYs in parallel with the builder stage, so this
# aborted the whole image build before any C++ was compiled -- which is why it
# looked like a compiler problem rather than a context problem.
# Re-include only the navmesh data; the .xlsx design tables next to it stay out.
!data/scene_nav_bin/
!data/scene_nav_bin/**

# Logs
*.log
bin/logs/
run/

# 发布制品与离线镜像包(docs/design/release-packaging-standard-20260914.md):
# 版本库外的制品根默认在 <仓库父目录>/artifacts,MMORPG_ARTIFACT_ROOT 指到仓库内时同样不进 context;
# fetch_images.ps1 默认落地到 deploy/offline-images/<版本>。镜像 tar 动辄数百 MB,
# 进了 context 会把每次构建拖慢到传输 tar。截至 2026-09-16,所有 Dockerfile 都不 COPY *.tar
# (仓库内唯二的 tar 是 third_party/boost/libs/{beast,url}/test/fuzz/seeds.tar,Boost 只作头文件用)。
deploy/offline-images/
artifacts/
**/*.tar
